OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA largely
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with a few patches of
OL,7,Flight drizzle at first. Then mostly
OL,8,Fdry and cloudy overnight, perhaps some
OL,9,Fclear spells developing in the north
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with some patchy light
OL,13,Frain and drizzle in the morning.
OL,14,FOutbreaks of rain will become more
OL,15,Fextensive through the afternoon,
OL,16,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,17,Fheavier later on.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
