OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,6,Fshowery outlook, some showers heavy,
OL,7,Fbrighter conditions too, feeling
OL,8,Ffresher from Wednesday with winds
OL,9,Fturning northerly.
